WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.736
Some places are very loud. Here is what we can do.

2
00:00:05.736 --> 00:00:12.960
Loud places can feel like too much: markets, parties, busy streets.

3
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:19.248
Our body might feel hot, or tight, or we want to cover our ears.

4
00:00:19.248 --> 00:00:25.680
We can wear ear defenders or earplugs. They make the sound smaller.

5
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.872
We can take a break outside or in a quiet corner. Breaks help.

6
00:00:31.872 --> 00:00:38.784
We can tell someone: it is too loud for me. That sentence works.

7
00:00:38.784 --> 00:00:44.424
Leaving early is allowed. Leaving is not failing.

8
00:00:44.424 --> 00:00:49.056
When it is quiet again, our body settles down.

9
00:00:49.056 --> 00:00:57.264
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

